#. Translators: the donation details. {number} is the GoPay phone number, {name} the account holder.
#. Translators: the donation details. {number} is the GoPay phone number, {name} the account
#. holder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Support the NusaNewsID developer\n"
"\n"
"Method: GoPay\n"
"Phone number: {number}\n"
"Name: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Every donation, whatever the amount, helps keep this add-on updated. Thank "
"you!"
msgstr ""
"Dukungan untuk pengembang NusaNewsID\n"
"\n"
"Metode: GoPay\n"
"Nomor HP: {number}\n"
"Atas nama: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Donasi berapa pun membantu add-on ini terus diperbarui. Terima kasih!"

#. Translators: title of the dialog that shows the GoPay donation details.
msgid "GoPay donation - NusaNewsID"
msgstr "Informasi Donasi GoPay - NusaNewsID"

msgid "Donation details:"
msgstr "Rincian donasi:"

#. Translators: button that copies the GoPay number to the clipboard.
msgid "Co&py number"
msgstr "&Salin nomor"

#. Translators: button that closes a dialog.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Tutup"

#. Translators: said after the GoPay number is copied. {number} is the number.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "GoPay number {number} copied."
msgstr "Nomor GoPay {number} disalin ke papan klip."

#. Translators: said when the GoPay number could not be copied.
msgid "Could not copy the number."
msgstr "Gagal menyalin nomor ke papan klip."

#. Translators: button that opens the donation details.
#. Translators: button of the installation welcome that shows the donation details.
msgid "&Donate"
msgstr "&Donasi"

#. Translators: button that closes the donation invitation.
#. Translators: a button that closes the update window; the add-on asks again another day.
#. Translators: button of the installation welcome that goes on with the installation.
msgid "&Not now"
msgstr "&Tidak sekarang"

#. Translators: the welcome shown once after installing. Keep NVDA+Shift+/.
msgid ""
"Welcome to NusaNewsID!\n"
"\n"
"This add-on follows Indonesian news sites in the background, announces new "
"stories, and opens whole articles in a window made for screen readers. Press "
"NVDA+Shift+/ to open the news list.\n"
"\n"
"If this add-on helps you, you can support its developer with a voluntary "
"donation through GoPay. Choose Donate to see the number, or Not now to close "
"this message."
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang di NusaNewsID!\n"
"\n"
"Add-on ini mengikuti situs berita Indonesia di latar belakang, mengumumkan "
"berita baru, dan membuka isi artikel di jendela yang dibuat untuk pembaca "
"layar. Tekan NVDA+Shift+/ untuk membuka daftar berita.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau add-on ini bermanfaat, Anda bisa mendukung pengembangnya lewat donasi "
"sukarela melalui GoPay. Pilih Donasi untuk melihat nomornya, atau Tidak "
"sekarang untuk menutup pesan ini."

#. Translators: title of the welcome shown once after installing.
#. Translators: title of the welcome shown while the add-on is being installed.
msgid "Welcome to NusaNewsID"
msgstr "Selamat Datang di NusaNewsID"

#. Translators: title of the occasional donation reminder.
msgid "Support the developer - NusaNewsID"
msgstr "Dukungan Pengembang - NusaNewsID"

#. Translators: the occasional donation reminder.
msgid ""
"We hope NusaNewsID helps you keep up with the news every day.\n"
"\n"
"If you want this add-on to keep being updated, you can support its developer "
"with a voluntary donation through GoPay. You can turn this reminder off in "
"the NusaNewsID settings."
msgstr ""
"Semoga NusaNewsID membantu Anda mengikuti berita setiap hari.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau Anda ingin add-on ini terus diperbarui, Anda bisa mendukung "
"pengembangnya lewat donasi sukarela melalui GoPay. Pengingat ini bisa "
"dimatikan di pengaturan NusaNewsID."

